The portable C in the scenario mouse-drag-menu: what it is expected to show
otherwise than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/mouse-drag-menu.txt,
see harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what
is expected in its place.
Deviation: 7, 12, 28 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: the Commands menu, two lines shorter, without Memory info and without EGA
lines; and the button let go as it reaches Commands leaves the bar on that
menu, not on the menu that is none, so Right goes to Options and not to Left

